Design specification followed
-----------------------------

- Material Design 3 (https://m3.material.io), a design system by Google.
  TreLVis's design tokens follow its colour role names and their pairings,
  its type scale (role names and sizes), and its shape, elevation and
  state-layer scales. The token template's colour values are the MD3
  baseline scheme (seed #6750A4). TreLVis includes no Material Design
  code, fonts, icons or images. TreLVis is not affiliated with or endorsed
  by Google.

  The Material Design site states: "All Material 3 content, guidelines,
  imagery, and resources are available under the Apache 2.0 or CC BY 4.0
  license." (https://m3.material.io/get-started). Attribution
  under CC BY 4.0: "Material Design 3" by Google (https://m3.material.io),
  licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes: TreLVis adapts
  the role names, scales and baseline colour values into C token types and
  a token template, and adds roles and uses MD3 doesn't define.

